<title>HONG KONG: Philippine National sets US$125 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Philippine National sets US$125 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PHILIPPINE NATIONAL BANK, HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$125 MLN  COUPON	3ML+65   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE   PAR	LAUNCH    17.FEB.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	 NONE     REPLIES   28.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT   BULLET   DENOMS    $100K</p>
<p> RATING     --	    SALE LMTS   PHIL/US/(NOT 144A)/HK/SING</p>
<p> TAX PROV   GROSS-UP, TAX CALL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF     YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  PHILIPPINE  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> PAY DATE   21.MAR.97 (TENTATIVE)</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS    US$7 MLN+    15BP   ALL-IN  70</p>
<p>   SENIOR MGRS     US$5-6 MLN   12BP   ALL-IN  69</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	  US$3-4 MLN    9BP   ALL-IN  68</p>
<p> ARRANGER AND BOOKRUNNER    HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p> CO-ARRANGERS   CREDIT LYONNAIS, FUJI INTERNATIONAL FINANCE (HK)</p>
<p>		    AND JP MORGAN SECURITIES ASIA.</p>
<p> PAY AGENT    HONGKONG AND SHANGHAI BANKING CORP</p>
<p> NOTES   ISSUER RATING BA2</p>
<p>	   DIRECT, UNSUBORDINATED, UNSECURED, UNCONDITIONAL.</p>
<p>	   CLEARING THROUGH EUROCLEAR AND CEDEL</p>
<p>	  *EARLY REDEMPTION IF GOVERNMENT OF PHILIPPINES</p>
<p>	   OWNS LESS THAN 30 PERCENT OF THE ISSUER</p>
<p>	   SIGNING IS SET FOR MARCH 14</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
